  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math> is defined by <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 9 left parenthesis 2 x plus 3 right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math>. For what value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> does <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 63\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>63</mn></mrow></math>?</p>",
